## AI (`Application/AI/`)

Roadmaps: `docs/ai-memory.md`, `docs/email-read-implementation-plan.md`.

### Layout

| Folder | Entry | Notes |
|--------|-------|-------|
| **AI/** root | `ChatOrchestrator.RunChatAgentAsync` | Turn routing |
| **Agents/** | `RunAsync` | `{Domain}TriageAgent` or `{Role}Agent` — see `AI/Agents/README.md` |
| **Tools/** | `CreateTools` | `{Domain}TriageTools` for triage; MAF tools, no LLM |
| **Memory/** | `EnrichHistoryAsync` / `RefreshAsync` | No LLM — see `docs/ai-memory.md` |
| **Workflows/** | `RunAsync` | Cross-cutting multi-step (not single agent turn) |

Register in `AddApplication()` only. Foundry factory in Infrastructure.

### File layout (top → bottom)

Usings → namespace `Application.AI.{Folder}` → `public sealed class` → public API → `# Supported User Prompts` (agents) → `# Private Helpers`

Constructor: underscore prefix on injected params (`_agentFactory`).

### Method regions (non-trivial)

`# Validate` → `# Execute` → `# Handle Result` (mirror Features handlers).

### Boundaries

- **Agents** — LLM only; no DB
- **Orchestrator** — routing; `ChatMessageRepository` for history
- **Tools / Memory** — slice repos; no LLM; no `IDbContextFactory`
- **Features** — `SendChatMessage` saves via repos, calls orchestrator, saves reply

### Supported User Prompts (agents only)

`private static readonly (string Intent, string Capability, string[] Prompts)[] SupportedUserPrompts` — debug/test catalog; **not** sent to LLM.

### Naming

`{Role}Agent` (non-triage), `{System}TriageAgent`, `{System}TriageTools`, `ChatOrchestrator`, `{entity}Repo` for injected repos, `RunChatAgentAsync` / `RunAsync` / `CreateTools`.
